020","source_title":"Student Union Renovation (2020)","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Meeting rooms require reservation through a UMass email account; check current building hours before going.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"university-museum-contemporary-art","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"University Museum of Contemporary Art","title":"See an exhibition at UMCA","subtitle":"Fine Arts Center, Amherst","notes":"Walk through the current galleries, then look for student educator, curatorial, internship, or work-study opportunities if you want to participate.","short_summary":"UMass’s teaching museum for contemporary-art exhibitions and student involvement.","evidence_claim":"UMass describes UMCA as its teaching museum and says admission is always free, with student educator, curatorial, internship, and work-study opportunities.","source_url":"https://www.umass.edu/admissions/articles/art-museums-umass-university-museum-contemporary-art","source_title":"Art Museums at UMass: University Museum of Contemporary Art","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The official page lists Tuesday–Friday and weekend hours, plus first-Thursday evening hours; it is closed Mondays, breaks, and state holidays.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umass-old-chapel","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Old Chapel","title":"Check the Old Chapel calendar","subtitle":"144 Hicks Way, Amherst","notes":"Look for a public lecture, workshop, or performance in the Great Hall, and allow walking time because there is no adjacent parking.","short_summary":"A restored historic campus building that hosts events in several spaces.","evidence_claim":"UMass describes Old Chapel as a central-campus even